What is a Private Endpoint?

A Private Endpoint gives an Azure service a private IP address inside your VNet.

Instead of reaching the service through a public endpoint, your resources connect to it privately.

Without Private Endpoint
VM
 │
 ▼
Public Endpoint
 │
 ▼
Storage
With Private Endpoint
VM
 │
 ▼
Private IP
 │
 ▼
Storage

The storage account can even have public network access disabled.

