Key Takeaways
Route Tables define how traffic is routed.
UDRs override Azure's default routing when custom traffic paths are required.
Service Endpoints provide secure access to Azure services while those services retain public endpoints.
Private Endpoints provide private IP-based access and are the preferred option for highly secure enterprise deployments.
In enterprise environments, Private Endpoints are commonly used with services like Azure Key Vault, Storage Accounts, and Azure SQL.
